---
/**
 * 质量分布的示意：人写的平均靠左，验证跟得上时 agent 的平均右移，
 * 右侧的 Good Code 刻度不动。区间位置是示意，不是测量。
 *
 * 动效和常驻 Agent 那篇博文同一套：两条分布滚进视口再出现，尽头的刻度一直在。
 */
import '../../blog/20261011 - alwaysOnAgents/figures.css'

import RevealBoot from '../../blog/20261011 - alwaysOnAgents/RevealBoot.astro'

const rows = [
  { label: '人写', from: 6, span: 36 },
  { label: 'agent + 验证', from: 22, span: 44, agent: true }
]
---

<figure class='aoa-fig slop-shift not-prose' data-slop-shift>
  <figcaption class='aoa-cap'>
    <strong>图 2 · 平均可以右移，Good Code 仍在尽头外面。</strong>
    色块是一大批改动落在哪一段。右端的刻度是三条同时成立的 Good Code。
  </figcaption>

  <div class='slop-shift-plot'>
    <div class='slop-shift-head' aria-hidden='true'>
      <span class='slop-shift-gap'></span>
      <span class='slop-shift-scale'>
        <span class='slop-shift-low'>较差</span>
        <span class='slop-shift-end'>Good Code</span>
      </span>
    </div>
    {
      rows.map((row, i) => (
        <div class='slop-shift-row aoa-rv' style={`--i: ${i}`}>
          <p class='slop-shift-label'>{row.label}</p>
          <div class='slop-shift-rail'>
            <span
              class:list={['slop-shift-mass', { 'slop-shift-mass-agent': row.agent }]}
              style={`--from: ${row.from}%; --span: ${row.span}%`}
              role='img'
              aria-label={`${row.label}的改动集中在轴上大约 ${row.from}% 到 ${row.from + row.span}% 的位置，还没到 Good Code`}
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </div>

  <p class='aoa-note'>
    示意图。第二行整体更靠右，右端仍空着一截。生成变快以后，较差的改动数量也可以同时变多。
  </p>
  <p class='aoa-sr'>
    两条示意分布。人写的改动集中在偏左。agent 加上验证之后，分布中心右移，但仍然停在 Good Code
    的刻度之前。
  </p>
  <RevealBoot />
</figure>

<script>
  import { armReveal } from '../../blog/20261011 - alwaysOnAgents/reveal'

  armReveal('[data-slop-shift]')
</script>

<style>
  .slop-shift-plot {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 14px;
    border: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .slop-shift-head,
  .slop-shift-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 9.2em minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .slop-shift-scale {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    min-width: 0;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
  }

  .slop-shift-low,
  .slop-shift-end {
    white-space: nowrap;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }

  .slop-shift-end {
    margin-left: auto;
    color: hsl(var(--foreground));
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .slop-shift-label {
    margin: 0;
    min-width: 0;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.35;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .slop-shift-rail {
    position: relative;
    min-width: 0;
    height: 22px;
    border-right: 2px solid hsl(var(--primary));
    border-bottom: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));
  }

  .slop-shift-mass {
    position: absolute;
    left: var(--from);
    bottom: 1px;
    width: var(--span);
    height: 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: hsl(222 6% 42%);
  }

  :global(.dark) .slop-shift-mass:not(.slop-shift-mass-agent) {
    background: hsl(220 7% 68%);
  }

  .slop-shift-mass-agent {
    background: hsl(var(--primary));
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .slop-shift-head,
    .slop-shift-row {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .slop-shift-gap {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .aoa-play .aoa-rv {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
